==Video Games==
===[[Ben 10 Ultimate Alien: Cosmic Destruction]]===
[[File:Terraspin CD.png|thumb|Terraspin in ''Cosmic Destruction'']]
Terraspin is one of the [[Andromeda (Classic)|Andromeda Galaxy]] aliens playable in the game.

Terraspin is able to use his powers to blast himself forward and up ramps.

Terraspin is vital for progression on The Catacombs and The Colosseum levels of the game. He is also the default optional alien for the Tokyo Nights level.

